.hopper/handoffs/T-033-output.log:717:889:.hopper/handoffs/T-005-output.md:448:  "text": "I'll research OpenClaw, Hermes Agent, and new-api facts for T-005 and write findings to the required handoff output. Gathering local task context and starting targeted web searches.Writing the research deliverable with confirmed facts and sources.## T-005 完成\n\n研究结果已写入 `.hopper/handoffs/T-005-output.md`（只读调研，仅该文件）。\n\n### 核心硬事实（浓缩）\n\n| 域 | 确认 | 未能确认 |\n|----|------|----------|\n| **OpenClaw** | `sessions.create` / `sessions.abort` / `chat.abort` / `sessions.delete` / `sessions.reset`；事件有 `seq` 且**官方明文不重放**；`runId` 可取消指定 run；审批以 approval id + first-answer-wins + timeout→deny | 无 `sessions.stop`；无 `capabilities_changed` 事件；abort 与 delete 非原子 |\n| **Hermes** | ACP 动词 = new/load/resume/fork/list/**cancel**；cancel 中断当前 prompt；CLI 有 `hermes sessions delete`；ACP 审批 allow_once/session/always/deny，超时 deny | ACP 无 delete/destroy/stop；CLI TTY 审批无公开可编程协议 |\n| **new-api** | 用户可多 token（name/group/quota）；`/api/usage/token`、`/api/log/self*`、admin `/api/log/`；rpm/tpm 近 60s | 非 per-request token；无已确认结算 webhook；客户端 correlation id 回查未确认 |\n\n### Verdict\n\n**PASS** — 足以支撑 D1 v2（openclaw + hermes）重设计事实基线。\n\n### Next\n\n把已确认条款回写 facts 基线；KernelPort 勿假设 `capabilities_changed` / 事件重放 / Hermes ACP delete / newapi webhook；成本归因用 **token-per-session** + log 过滤。",
