    56	## Stop Conditions
    57	
    58	Stop when:
    59	
    60	- Blocking condition: human-decision-required / access-missing / write-safety-required 且下一安全动作需用户输入时
    61	- Blocker type: 见下方 Blocker Classification（协议 7 类）
    62	- Missing evidence: TODO (owner: user)
    63	- Environment mismatch: **停下来报告，不自动继续**（user-confirmed 2026-08-04）——当
    64	  `state/environment.md` 的 `Expected model` / `Expected effort/reasoning` 与本会话实际
    65	  不符时，主会话须在继续门输出里显式点出「声称 X / 实际 Y」，并停止，等用户裁决
    66	  （改期望值 / 换回原模型 / 明确接受本次不符）。**不得自行把期望值改成实际值当作"已解决"**
    67	  ——那是把不符消除在记录里而不是解决它。此前本字段为 TODO，2026-08-04 的
    68	  AUDIT-20260804-PRECONTINUE-SG10 首次实际撞上不符（声称 claude-fable-5、实际
    69	  claude-opus-5[1m]）时无规则可依，故补此条
    70	- Model/effort mismatch: TODO (owner: user)
    71	- Contract cannot be evaluated: TODO (owner: user)
    72	
    73	## Blocker Classification
    74	
    75	| Type | Continue behavior | User input required |
    76	| --- | --- | --- |
    77	| runtime-recoverable | Start read-only investigation or recovery-planning round | no |
    78	| access-missing | Stop and ask for missing access/tool facts | yes |
    79	| write-safety-required | Stop before mutation; ask for write safety and confirmation | yes |
    80	| human-decision-required | Stop and ask for decision | yes |
    81	| contract-insufficient | Repair contract before execution | maybe |
    82	| external-system-unsafe | Allow bounded observation only | maybe |
    83	| unknown | Ask for facts needed to classify | yes |
    84	
    85	协议 7 类照录；其中 runtime-recoverable 与 contract-insufficient 可自恢复（后者限契约修复动作，不得借此扩大到业务执行）。
    86	
