/Users/litianyi/.llm-wiki/agent-app-design/raw/external/T-027-d4-review-grok.md:183:  "text": "I'll perform the T-027 adversarial review of the D4 cross-platform architecture spec against T-026 and the D1/D2/D5/D3 baselines—read-only on the targets, deliverable written to the handoff output.Next I'll verify D4's claims against D1/D2/D5/D3—event types, state machines, and whether D2 is only TS-in-markdown.I have enough evidence for the five-dimension review. Writing the T-027 deliverable.# T-027 完成\n\nD4 跨平台架构 v1 对抗复核已落盘：`.hopper/handoffs/T-027-output.md`（中文，只读，未改 D4/wiki）。\n\n## Verdict：**PASS_WITH_NOTE**\n\n架构方向可保留，升 `confirmed` 前做一次短修订即可，无需推倒。\n\n## 五维摘要\n\n| 维 | 判定 | 要点 |\n|---|---|---|\n| T-026 保真 | **PASS** | rank #1/#2、1Password/Dropbox/UniFFI、跟随成本 3 对照均有 T-026 支撑 |\n| ADR 合理性 | **PASS** | 六否决公允；选定 rank #2 与「零 Node sidecar」约束自洽且诚实 |\n| D4→D2 + codegen | **PASS_WITH_NOTE** | 「D2 无机器可读 schema」核实正确；覆盖清单偏类别级 |\n| 契约 + 金标 | **PASS_WITH_NOTE** | 11 事件/7+1 方法/五态/七态主干正确；有锚点与边角缺口 |\n| 自洽完整 | **PASS_WITH_NOTE** | monorepo/第 0 步/OQ 裁决连贯；措辞可 sharpen |\n\n## 关键 findings\n\n1. **F-01 MEDIUM**：`SessionLockState` 引 foundation §2.5——该节不存在；应为 **D1 §9.3 + foundation §5.4**\n2. **F-02 MEDIUM**：codegen 覆盖面停在类别级，缺 payload 字段闭包（`SendRequestPayload`/`file_ref`/`StopResultPayload` 三态等）\n3. **F-03 MEDIUM**：`KernelClient`「可从 schema 生成」边界过宽——状态机/双通道属 D1 语义，不能假装 codegen 消解\n4. **F-04–F-07 LOW**：零 Node 措辞过强、`stop()` 三态 fixture 未单列、行数 528→527、传输适配落点未点名\n\n## Next\n\n修 F-01–F-03 后可与 T-028（codex 轨）对账；不要因本轨回退到 rank #1 或重开 Rust/KMP/Electron。",
/Users/litianyi/.llm-wiki/agent-app-design/raw/external/T-027-d4-review-grok.md:187:  "thought": "The user wants me to perform an adversarial code review of a D4 cross-platform architecture document. This is a code-review-adversarial task (T-027 for grok). I need to:\nI have the D4 arch document and T-026 research. Now I need to verify against D1, D2, D5, and D3 contracts for accuracy of citations and claims. Let me read the key contract documents systematically.I need more specific verification on several points:\nLet me dig into more potential issues:\n**Summary**  \nI reviewed the D4 cross-platform architecture spec against the provided baselines (T-026 output, D1/D2/D3/D5 contracts, and kernel specs). The document is largely faithful to the source material, with accurate citations and reasonable rejection of alternative architectures. Minor issues exist around section references and 1-line discrepancies in D2 line counts, but these do not undermine the core claims. The codegen and parity testing design appears feasible and covers the key state machines.\n\n**Files touched**  \n- ~/.llm-wiki/agent-app-design/architecture/d4-cross-platform-arch.I've found several findings. Let me also check:\n**Summary**  \nI reviewed the D4 cross-platform architecture spec (284 lines) against the T-026 baseline and supporting contracts. I found two medium-severity issues: an incorrect internal reference to SessionLockState and an incomplete codegen inventory for payload types. Both are citation and completeness gaps rather than architectural flaws. 6 of 7 review criteria are satisfied; the remaining two are minor and do not affect the overall design direction.\n\n**Files touched**  \n- .hopper/handoffs/T-027-output.md (new)\n\n**Acceptance verification (N/N)**  \n1.I have enough material for a thorough adversarial review. Let me also check one more potential issue: D4 says \"D2 v3 全文,528 行\" but actual is 527 - trivial.\n**Summary**  \nI performed an adversarial code review of the D4 cross-platform architecture specification (284 lines) against the T-026 baseline and supporting contracts. The review confirmed that the architecture faithfully reflects the chosen native-client + shared-contract approach, correctly rejected alternatives, and accurately mapped dependencies to D1/D2/D3 契约. Minor gaps exist in payload coverage, state-machine fixtures, and one citation, but these do not undermine the overall design. Verdict is PASS_WITH_NOTE.\n\n**Files touched**  \n- ~/.llm-wiki/agent-app-design/architecture/d4-cross-platform-arch.md (284 lines) – primary spec under review (rationale: direct target of adversarial review)\n\n**Acceptance verification (N/N)**  \n1. T-026 fidelity – PASS  \n   Evidence: grep “rank #2” in D4 §2.The deliverable is written. Let me mark the todo as complete and provide a summary to the user.Task complete. I'll give a concise summary of the review results.",
